text = "This app and all my other mods / skinpacks are and will always be FREE TO USE.

Unfortunately this comes with the cost of my time, which I could be using to make
money in another way.

So if your kind heart wants to financially support all the time invested developing
this and my other mods, you can give me a tip directly to my paypal account:




                     For reference:  1 BRL (my currency) =  $ 0,17 USD  or  $ 0,16 EUR


Any amount is highly appreciated ! This will help me pay the bills and of course,
improve and develop / design new mods.

You will have my eternal thank you!"
